# .easignore overrides .gitignore for EAS Build archiving.
# The root .gitignore excludes android/ (and google-services.json), but EAS
# prebuild needs google-services.json. This keeps the android/ SOURCE (so the
# file is present) while still dropping heavy build artifacts + node_modules.
# Local build only — nothing is uploaded to a remote builder.

# Heavy / regenerated
**/node_modules/
**/.expo/
**/dist/
**/web-build/
**/coverage/
**/.gradle/
**/build/
**/android/app/build/
**/ios/build/
**/ios/Pods/

# Noise / local secrets we don't want in the archive
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
